  "evidenceFlow": [
    "按item_id + question_id对齐Kev、StartLux Instant、StartLux AutoThink与原题",
    "校验选项概率、choice=argmax和7,800题完整覆盖",
    "计算pmax、p_gold、gold_rank、top1-top2 margin与gold gap",
